  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "有機化學",
    "sub_ename": "ORGANIC CHEMISTRY",
    "describe_ch": "本課程說明有機化合物特性、合成方法、反應機構與構造鑑定分析，以官能基分類，有機化合物可區分為烷、烯、炔、芳香族、醇、醚、醛、酮、酸、胺與衍生物，依此逐章講述。",
    "describe_eh": "Chemical properties synthetic methods, reaction mechanisms and structural identifications of organic compounds will be described. Chapters of organic compounds based upon functional groups clarification will be introduced step by step. Alkanes, alkenes, alkynes, aromatics, alcohols, ethers, aldehydes, ketones, acids, amines, and their derivatives will be covered in this course.",
